// A comment before the title.
title Comments everywhere

// A comment between the title and the first element.
anchor Customer [0.95, 0.63]
component Cup of Tea [0.79, 0.61] // a trailing comment on an element

// A comment between elements, with a blank line either side.

component Kettle [0.43, 0.35]

Customer->Cup of Tea // a trailing comment on a link
// A comment between two links.
Cup of Tea->Kettle

// A comment at the end of the file.
